<td colspan="3"><strong>Our service fees does not include test registration or score request</strong></td>
        </script>
        
        <script type="text/template" id="template-remark-service-fee">
<td colspan="3"><strong>Our service fees does not include test registration or score request</strong></td>
        </script>
        
        <script type="text/template" id="template-remark-training">
<td colspan="3">
    <strong>Remark:</strong>
    <ul>
        <li>No make class if the student misses a class.</li> 
        <li>Class will resume 3 hours after any of the signals (typhoon #8, black rainstorm signal, red rainstorm signal) is removed.</li>  
        <li>Typhoon signal #8 : class will be cancelled and there will be make up class.</li>
